// =============================================================================
// SettingsModal — pixel-perfect twin of reference/settings.html, made interactive
//
// Markup + CSS are embedded VERBATIM from the captured Google Calendar Settings
// page so rendering is identical. CSS is scoped under `.gc-settings-root`.
// Behaviour layered on top of the static capture:
//   - personal name/email replaced with a generic "Personal calendar"
//   - left-nav rows scroll the main panel to the matching heading
//   - the value fields with a dropdown arrow (Language, Country, Date/Time
//     format, Default duration, ...) open a real selectable menu that updates
//   - native inputs / checkboxes work as-is
//   - advanced/unavailable section (Workspace smart features) shows a ban cursor
//   - the fixed 1512px design scales to fit narrower viewports (responsive)
// =============================================================================

